aying Bruce Wayne I think they're  really kind of fleshing out his  character and you're beginning to see  his his development into uh into you  know the Caped Crusader into Batman and  yeah I think you know he's beginning to  get stronger he's beginning to get more  courageous and  and yet and it's kind of you can see how  all these all these really unhinged  villains and Gotham were beginning to  kind of you know shape him into the into  the hero he's going to be so yeah I  think it would be it'd be really cool  for for Victor to kind of step in and  and and kind of make his mark  I suppose what do you think Victor's  response would be to meeting mr. freeze  or Clayface or Mad Hatter oh I'm sure  they would be all different responses  but um yeah I think um I don't know a  couple words come to mind he would be  very curious and yeah I mean probably  yeah probably very threatened and  curious I would say yeah now of course  you've been in the flash as well how do  you compare your character of the mist  in the flash compared to Victor well I  think yeah um yes o'connell Nimbus is a  lot more of like a thug you know he's  he's a bruiser and and it's it's a lot  of fun to play but Victor is a lot more  you know playful and colorful and  mischievous they're both totally  maniacal but yeah different you know  different flavors there what are the  chances are that we'll see you back in  the flash do you think you know I can I  cannot say I can't literally but but you  know neither of my characters are dead  and they're both at large so you'll have  to tune and find out and course we heard  recently that Robin Lord Tyler who we  know is a penguin on Gotham would very  much also like to be in the flesh so  joining you on that what do you think of  that I didn't know that but I think  Robin is so talented and I would watch  him I would watch him like fold laundry  hahaha yeah and what would you love to  see going forward in season two of  Gotham uh well you know I think um  I would love to just continue watching  the unfolding of all these brilliant  characters just kind of you know go  deeper and deeper into this world and  yeah the creators have done a really  great job introducing everything now  it's yeah it's time to just buckle your  seatbelts and enjoy the ride that's the  answer it's been lovely talking to you  thanks so much your time thank you so  much appreciated  you
 

